{
  "schema": "2.0",
  "config": { "compact_width": false },
  "header": {
    "template": "blue",
    "title": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "决策反馈" }
  },
  "body": {
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**Agent：** {{agent_name}}　**场景：** {{scene}}　**归属层：** {{layer}}",
        "text_align": "left"
      },
      { "tag": "hr" },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "### 采纳\n如采纳上述建议，可填写补充说明（可选），然后点「提交」",
        "text_align": "left"
      },
      {
        "tag": "form",
        "name": "adopt_form",
        "direction": "vertical",
        "elements": [
          {
            "tag": "input",
            "name": "adopt_feedback",
            "input_type": "multiline_text",
            "placeholder": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "采纳说明（可选），如：按建议执行 / 调整量级后执行" },
            "max_length": 1000
          },
          {
            "tag": "button",
            "type": "primary",
            "text": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "提交" },
            "form_action_type": "submit",
            "form_name": "adopt_form",
            "behaviors": [
              {
                "type": "callback",
                "value": {
                  "action": "adopt_submit",
                  "agent_name": "{{agent_name}}",
                  "scene": "{{scene}}",
                  "layer": "{{layer}}"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      { "tag": "hr" },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "### 不采纳\n请写明：**① 结论**（部分采纳 / 完全不采纳）　**② 具体原因**",
        "text_align": "left"
      },
      {
        "tag": "form",
        "name": "veto_form",
        "direction": "vertical",
        "elements": [
          {
            "tag": "input",
            "name": "user_feedback",
            "input_type": "multiline_text",
            "placeholder": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "例：部分采纳，量从 2000 双减到 1000 双，9 月再评估 / 完全不采纳，热度数据未核实，需补充佐证" },
            "max_length": 1000
          },
          {
            "tag": "button",
            "type": "danger",
            "text": { "tag": "plain_text", "content": "提交" },
            "form_action_type": "submit",
            "form_name": "veto_form",
            "behaviors": [
              {
                "type": "callback",
                "value": {
                  "action": "veto_submit",
                  "agent_name": "{{agent_name}}",
                  "scene": "{{scene}}",
                  "layer": "{{layer}}"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
